    "name": {
     "en": "Shimizuya",
     "ja": "清水屋"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Founded in 1940 and known for the fried manjū sold to people visiting Myōhōji. Since 2015 it has also been a soba shop, where the third-generation owner makes the noodles by hand.",
     "ja": "1940年創業、妙法寺名物「揚げまんじゅう」で知られる店。2015年からは三代目が手打ちする蕎麦屋になり、揚げまんじゅうも今も売っている。"
    },
